      },
      {
        "id": "A20",
        "page": 36,
        "quote": "PMMA Flame Tip Comparison\nPartial-G\n(cm/s)\n1-G\n(cm/s)\nRatio\n.15\n.40\n.38\nFlame Tip Spread (from linear fits):\n𝑥𝑓𝑏\n𝑥𝑓𝑡\nSample\nFlame\ng\n𝑙𝑓\n𝑉𝑓",
        "in_task": true
      },
      {
        "id": "A21",
        "page": 37,
        "quote": "The LUCI project achieved the first-ever, extended duration combustion tests (greater than 25 seconds) in simulated \nLunar gravity.",
        "in_task": true
      },
      {
        "id": "A22",
        "page": 37,
        "quote": "The results are applicable to NASA’s exploration efforts in that they guide the selection of fire-safe \nmaterials and environments and ensure safety of future spacecraft and Lunar habitats.",
        "in_task": true
      },
      {
        "id": "A23",
        "page": 37,
        "quote": "The data also provides \nfundamental understanding of fires burning at reduced gravity for comparison to sophisticated numerical models.",
        "in_task": true
      },
      {
        "id": "A24",
        "page": 37,
        "quote": "Finally, the experiment is a steppingstone to the ultimate goal of performing burn tests on the Lunar surface in the \nFlammability of Materials on the Moon (FM2) experiment which will fly on a SpaceX Human Lander System \nunmanned test flight.",
        "in_task": true
      },
      {
        "id": "A25",
        "page": 38,
        "quote": "Backups",
        "in_task": true
      }
